<title>THAILAND: Thai Fund 3-yr notes average yield 8.96 pct.</title>
<headline>Thai Fund 3-yr notes average yield 8.96 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand announced on Friday the following result of a notes auction by its Financial Institutions Development Fund:</p>
<p>   MATURITY  TENDER AMT   ALLOTED AMT    AVG YIELD    RANGE</p>
<p>		 (MLNS BAHT)  (MLNS BAHT)</p>
<p>   3 years     7,335	   2,000	   8.96     8.85-9.07</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
</text>
